    <description>Suricata ET MALWARE: TonRAT Node.js implant C2 traffic detected — photo-zip hospitality campaign (T1071.001)</description>
    <mitre>
      <id>T1071.001</id>
    </mitre>
    <group>ids,suricata,tonrat,nodejs_implant,dprk_adjacent,</group>
  </rule>

</group>
